THIRD-PARTY DERIVATIVE WORK

  assets/bertieprogression/ponder/athanor_altar.nbt

is a copy of Magitech's `data/magitech/structure/athanor_altar.nbt`, the blueprint
its Athanor Pillar validates against. It is shipped so the Ponder scene can show
players the finished altar; Ponder resolves a scene's schematic from assets by
ResourceLocation and offers no way to hand it a structure loaded at runtime, so
the file has to live here. Magitech is by Stln and is distributed under
